elaborate umbrella made of thin metal wires strung across its canopy. This umbrella is decorated with countless small lights, creating a starry effect against the dim background. It seems to have some sort of mechanical component at its base.\n\n---\n\n### Environment & Setting\n\nThe setting is grand but dilapidated, suggesting a once-magnificent structure now ruined.\n- **Architecture**:\n    - On the right-hand side, there's a glass-walled chamber illuminated by intense red light inside. Within this enclosure, monstrous figures—a demonic face with sharp teeth and horns—are visible through the transparent walls.\n    - To the far left, another section features more classical architecture reminiscent of temples or palaces with curved roofs and tiled eaves.\n    - The upper part of the dome reveals a massive, bright white circular object—the moon—is partially obscured by broken beams and debris hanging below it like chain links.\n    - Above all these structures hangs a complex network of twisted steel cables suspended between towering supports.\n- **Atmosphere**:\n    - The overall color palette consists primarily of muted grays, blacks, whites, and sepia tones, which gives the environment a somber mood.\n    - There’s significant contrast created by the warm glow emanating from within the chambers on the right versus the cold, stark lighting above.\n\n---\n\n### Composition & Style\n\n- **Perspective**: The camera angle looks up towards the ceiling, emphasizing the scale and height of the surrounding buildings.\n- **Lighting**: Strong backlighting comes from behind the main subject, illuminating her silhouette while casting shadows throughout the room. The internal luminescence adds depth and mystery.\n- **Artistic Technique**: The style combines realistic rendering for details such as fabric folds and metallic textures with painterly brushstrokes used for backgrounds and sky areas. This hybrid approach creates a visually rich yet surreal experience.\n\nIn summary, this piece portrays a powerful fantasy narrative where a mysterious woman commands attention amidst crumbling ruins, possibly serving as a guardian or enforcer within a forgotten temple-like sanctuary under siege."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 50, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "title": "反推提示词(可编辑)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [419.484375, 199.484375], "pos": [327.9265441894531, 95.25334167480469], "id": 12, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.28.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [54], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["lanczos", 2, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 45, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "label": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "upscale_method"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution_steps"}, "name": "resolution_steps", "label": "resolution_steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "resolution_steps"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [299.140625, 139.421875], "pos": [-345.8117370605469, 742.4786987304688], "id": 23, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.28.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [56], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [389.54687